# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local environment overrides for ION Hub | NFT Studio
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values.
# `.env.local` is automatically gitignored by Create React App, so secrets
# never reach GitHub.

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pinata IPFS uploads
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by the Configure-Collection form to pin cover images and metadata
# JSON to IPFS.
#
# Setup:
#   1. Sign up at https://pinata.cloud (free tier, 1 GB)
#   2. Settings → API Keys → New Key
#   3. Tick the scopes: pinFileToIPFS + pinJSONToIPFS  (others not needed)
#   4. Copy the JWT (long string starting with `eyJ…`)
#   5. Paste below, no quotes
#
# Restart `npm start` after editing this file (CRA only reads env vars at
# server boot).

REACT_APP_PINATA_JWT=
